---
title: "M10 Dental Charts: TO-BE (with the system)"
---
flowchart TB
    subgraph L0[" "]
    direction LR
      S3["<b>PATIENT</b><br/>Sees a simplified current chart in the portal"]:::manual
    end
    subgraph L1[" "]
    direction LR
      S2["<b>FRONT DESK</b><br/>Sees the chart read-only (no notes)"]:::manual
    end
    subgraph L2[" "]
    direction LR
      S0["<b>DENTIST</b><br/>Taps a tooth; records a status (Owner's list), surfaces, date, note"]:::manual
    end
    subgraph L3[" "]
    direction LR
      S4["<b>OWNER</b><br/>Chooses FDI or Universal numbering and the status list"]:::manual
    end
    subgraph L4[" "]
    direction LR
      S1["<b>SYSTEM</b><br/>Keeps every entry (append-only); the latest per tooth is the current chart<br/><i>System does it</i>"]:::auto
    end
